# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing in this repo should ever contain personal data.
#
# Aimless stores walks in the browser (IndexedDB), never on disk, and
# exports download to ~/Downloads by default - they do not touch this
# folder. The rules below are belt-and-braces in case one is ever moved
# or saved here by hand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# Exported walks: these contain base64 photographs AND exact GPS
# coordinates. The single most sensitive thing this project can produce.
exports/
*.aimless.html
*export*.html
*export*.json
walk-*.html
walk-*.json
*.gpx
*.geojson

# Photographs and stray screenshots. The PWA's own icons are the only
# images that belong in git, so they are re-included below.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.heif
*.webp
*.png
!public/icons/**

# Secrets. Phase 2 adds an AI key - it lives in the environment, never here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local databases, should any appear
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# There should be no dependencies at all. If this directory appears,
# something has been added that shouldn't have been - see docs/roadmap.md A2.
node_modules/

.DS_Store
*.log

# Styling playground — local design experiments, not part of the app
test/styling-tests.html
test/css-guide.md
test/styling-tests-safelight.html
test/styling-tests-coralreef.html
test/styling-tests-chartroom.html
test/scroll-snap-picker.html
test/scroll-snap-picker-v2.html
docs/ui-map.md
docs/iching/
